  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 3 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nNestled in the highly sought after heart of Milford, 2/8 Shakespeare Road presents a fantastic opportunity for first home buyers, downsizers or astute investors looking to secure a prime piece of real estate on the flat.   \r\n\r\nThe home enjoys open plan kitchen, dining and living areas that flow out to an exclusive grass area, small enough to be easily maintained but with room to plant a few veges and potter about. There are also 3 bedrooms, a family bathroom and an ensuite toilet.   \r\n\r\nThe garaging is internal plus there is off-street parking, however, public transport is literally on your doorstep.   Enjoy the benefits of a heat pump and HRV system where you can be warm in winter and cool in summer.   \r\n\r\nA new roof has been installed but there is scope to add value and make the home your own.   \r\n\r\nZoned for sought after schools including Milford Primary, Takapuna Normal Intermediate School, Takapuna Grammar and Westlake Boys’ & Girls High Schools.   \r\n\r\nThe location is unbeatable with a short stroll to Milford Village, Milford beach and just moments away from Lake Pupuke, North Shore Hospital and Smales Farm transport hub.   \r\n\r\nJoin us at our open homes or call for a private viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
